kout requires a Mav ID or membership card; facility hours and activity space are subject to change.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"college-park-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"College Park Center","title":"Locate College Park Center","subtitle":"Seventh stop: event venue on campus","notes":"Walk by College Park Center to recognize the venue, then consult its event calendar when you want to plan around a specific game or performance.","short_summary":"Know where a major UTA event venue sits in relation to campus.","evidence_claim":"College Park Center is identified on UTA’s official campus map.","source_url":"https://www.uta.edu/-/media/project/website/maps/pdf/UTA%20Campus%20Map.pdf","source_title":"UTA Campus Map","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-09-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Event admission, dates, and building access depend on the specific program; check its current listing.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uta-planetarium","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"UTA Planetarium","title":"Plan a Planetarium show","subtitle":"Eighth stop: astronomy on campus","notes":"Check the rotating schedule, choose a show that fits your weekend, and reserve a ticket before arriving for the hour-long program.","short_summary":"A scheduled campus activity with science programming and a sky tour.","evidence_claim":"UTA says its public shows include a full-dome feature, Texas sky tour, and astronomer Q&A; each show lasts about one hour.","source_url":"https://www.uta.edu/planetarium/shows","source_title":"UTA Planetarium Public Shows and Events","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Public-show schedules rotate. UTA lists student public-show admission at $5; check the current schedule and ticket availability.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"downtown-arlington-levitt-pavilion","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Levitt Pavilion Arlington","title":"Finish with a free concert, when scheduled","subtitle":"Ninth stop: Founders Plaza, downtown Arlington","notes":"If a free-concert date lines up, bring a lawn chair or blanket and check the event listing before heading to Founders Plaza.","short_summary":"An outdoor downtown option for a scheduled evening.","evidence_claim":"Levitt Pavilion Arlington’s official venue page lists free concerts and identifies the venue at 100 W. Abram St.","source_url":"https://levittpavilionarlington.org/venue/levitt-pavilion/","source_title":"Levitt Pavilion Arlington Events","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Attend only an event explicitly labeled free on the official calendar; listed free concerts run 7:10–10:00 p.m. on scheduled dates.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"maverick-stampede","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Maverick Stampede","title":"Bookmark Maverick Stampede for the next kickoff","subtitle":"Tenth stop: plan a future campus event","notes":"Before the weekend ends, review Student Activities information and bookmark Maverick Stampede so you can join the official semester kickoff when it returns.","short_summary":"A documented UTA activity to watch for as the semester begins.","evidence_claim":"UTA identifies Maverick Stampede as the official kick-off to the new semester.","source_url":"https://www.uta.edu/student-affairs/student-activities","source_title":"UTA Student Activities","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This is a recurring semester kickoff, not a guaranteed first-weekend event; check Student Activities for current dates and access details.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Campus-map publication date is represented as 2025-09-01 because the official PDF search record provides month/year but no day. Verify venue schedules and access before departure."]}],"warnings":["One source publication date is month-level in the official map record; it is normalized to 2025-09-01."]}
